## Brake repairs and services

The full range of air brake work for heavy-duty trucks and fleets:

- Air brake inspections
- Brake chamber replacements
- Slack adjuster adjustments and replacements
- Air hose repairs
- Drum and rotor resurfacing
- Brake shoe replacements
- ABS system diagnostics and repairs

## Preventative maintenance for brakes

Brake inspections, slack adjuster adjustments and air hose checks are the
routine that keeps a braking system inside spec instead of drifting out of it.
Scheduled maintenance also keeps drums and rotors from wearing early, which is
the difference between a shoe replacement and a full brake job.

{% callout tone="safety" title="Do not run on a suspect air system" %}
Reduced braking power, uneven pressure across axles or an audible air leak is a
park-it condition, not a get-it-back-to-the-yard condition. Call us and we will
tell you whether it moves.
{% /callout %}

